{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cfd50be8-0c72-8239-a087-075415449dc9",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T12:11:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Siobhan Gallagher",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:09:15-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:09:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Priya. This is Siobhan Gallagher. Basically I'm trying to get a month by month breakdown of our water and sewer usage, for the last year if you have it. I'm putting together a budget."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:09:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can look into that. Can I have the account name or the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:09:37-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, basically the account is still in my husband's name. He passed a while back and I never switched it over. I'd rather not give the address on a cell phone while I'm driving, if the name works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:09:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. What was his name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:09:53-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Declan Gallagher. G-A-L-L-A-G-H-E-R."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:09:55-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Give me a moment. [pause] I have it. Okay, so the bills here are quarterly, which means the statements show usage over a three-month period. Do you want me to see whether we have anything broken out by month?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:10:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Basically I need to know what the monthly average looks like. If it's only quarterly, I can divide, but I'd like the actual readings if they exist."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:10:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I can see the billing history, but the meter reading detail sits with the water division. I'd want them to confirm what's available and in what format. Can I have them call you back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:10:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that works. Use this number, 401-555-0176. Basically anytime this afternoon is fine, or tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:10:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0176, under Gallagher. I'll note that you want monthly usage for the past twelve months, and that the account is in your late husband's name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:10:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Sorry, I'm about to turn onto Memorial, and I always take the long way home to avoid that left by the school. It's a tricky one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:10:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, go ahead and drive. Someone will be in touch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:11:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Priya. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T12:11:03-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
